# Web (`minirust-web`)

SSR-only Leptos (`features = ["ssr"]`), served by Axum. Do not add hydration, `cargo-leptos`, or WASM unless the user asks.

- Render with `view! { ... }.to_html()` and prefix `<!DOCTYPE html>`.
- Call `GreetingService` / `HealthService`. Do not duplicate API business rules.
- Default development address is `127.0.0.1:3001`.
- Baseline routes: `GET /` (HTML), `GET /health`.
- Do not build CMS, auth UI, dashboards, or resume tools here yet.

```rust
pub fn render_home_page(message: &str) -> String {
    let html = view! { <HomePage message=message.to_owned()/> }.to_html();
    format!("<!DOCTYPE html>{html}")
}
```
